# Keep the working tree in LF on every platform. Without this, Git's Windows
# autocrlf rewrites checked-out files to CRLF and `npm run lint` fails.
* text=auto eol=lf

*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.webp binary
*.avif binary
*.ico binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary
*.ttf binary
